<title>Syria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/syria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-syria-2026-10-29T10:16:28.272Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 10:16:28 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Jordan has resumed airstrikes in southern Syria against Daesh militants, prompting Syrian authorities to condemn the raids as a breach of airspace and to report civilian casualties. Syrian security forces killed a French jihadist in a shootout in Harem and another French fighter in Idlib, while unidentified gunmen killed two Syrian defence ministry personnel in Idlib. The two sides have reopened the Nasib border crossing and agreed to a joint security committee and investigation into the strikes. The conflict produced 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/27/unacceptable-violation-syria-condemns-jordan-airstrikes&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiywFBVV95cUxOUTlkRXhpdTRCZ2g4U0hDdDlkZlBWVDFkTTg2WWhBUXktS3c4akJZck9XbHdmdkpsazJiSVdjUmcxdFdZRmhITzEwRU9vS0pUNkFWSThqZlhYMUVWVnV3ZHRtRVlvdDdrSWhQSGQ0Zy1HOXhNbDEydkRscGV1eG04Q1A4a0VlajhCLTJpVTJYMVhzVzgzb0VTLUpURGl4c0VvanhreWVJcm1RUFNzRnFUMjliUlVZOURxOHlFWmVMNWNPTWsyT1p5a2trNA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxPRm51dlJtSHd5NVdOQ2RXbHU5aGltTktXY2xqU1pRdUFrQTBIcnRKOWlieUNYaWxoVDh3aUtjcmdOQm1iY01oSnR1Uy1DR1hZT29kdTdhbTI1RnY4QWw1SGVHU3IwdDBidzB1Y0V3UHc4TFVDcjRXY1p3b0tXc3I0dnBCcUw0RElMRFBFZFRHRQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;شفق نيوز&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxNYUFiSXVnZGVfSmNZdGZvN3NOdWFURUF0OEw1eXJocnRibkRXRjhoT2VMUFhpeDJDdDVzdDdNWmxfOTE4bm1fTEs0UnkxRVRacThWNTRMNVVVdzhmZG5Bb1o1ODJ5QUxsR01hc0tZQmxqLXNQNzk0QUNLcE1ST3hYc0lNSGxYQlpsRHJ